<!-- ===================== COVER ===================== -->
<header class="cover">
  <div class="kicker">The Scarcity Inversion &middot; A Field Guide</div>
  <h1 class="title">The Human <span class="amp">Leverage</span> Map</h1>
  <p class="dek">When intelligence becomes abundant and cheap, judgment becomes scarce. This is a map for finding the value that survives AI &mdash; the part of what you create that doesn&rsquo;t collapse when the machine can produce the answer.</p>

  <div class="memo">
    <div><span class="lbl">TO</span> <b>Leaders, builders, and anyone whose work is being automated from the inside</b></div>
    <div><span class="lbl">FROM</span> <b>Anuj Sadani</b> &middot; Principal SDE, builder of AI systems and the teams behind them</div>
    <div><span class="lbl">RE</span> <b>Where uniquely human value goes when intelligence is abundant</b></div>
  </div>

  <figure>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 760 470" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="The Human Leverage Map: a two-by-two quadrant. The horizontal axis is AI Capability, rising from Ignore to AI-Native. The vertical axis is Human Leverage, rising from Survival to Stewardship. Bottom-left quadrant: The Resistant. Bottom-right: The Prompt Addict. Top-left: The Wise Expert. Top-right, shaded teal: The Amplifier, Steward of Intelligence. A dashed judgment waterline runs horizontally between Expertise and Judgment.">
      <!-- top-right durable quadrant wash -->
      <rect x="400" y="60" width="280" height="160" fill="#E3EEEA"/>
      <!-- plot frame -->
      <rect x="120" y="60" width="560" height="320" fill="none" stroke="#D9D5C8" stroke-width="1.4"/>
      <!-- quadrant dividers -->
      <line x1="400" y1="60" x2="400" y2="380" stroke="#D9D5C8" stroke-width="1.2"/>
      <!-- judgment waterline -->
      <line x1="120" y1="220" x2="680" y2="220" stroke="#0F6E63" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="6 5"/>
      <text x="676" y="212" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="10" fill="#0A5147" text-anchor="end" font-weight="600">judgment waterline</text>
      <text x="124" y="236" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="9" fill="#9A9E95">expertise below &middot; judgment above</text>

      <!-- quadrant labels -->
      <text x="260" y="142" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="13" fill="#0A5147" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">The Wise Expert</text>
      <text x="260" y="160" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="9" fill="#6B716C" text-anchor="middle">low capability &middot; high leverage</text>

      <text x="540" y="118" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="13" fill="#0F6E63" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">The Amplifier /</text>
      <text x="540" y="136" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="13" fill="#0F6E63" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">Steward of Intelligence</text>
      <text x="540" y="156" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="9" fill="#0A5147" text-anchor="middle">the durable summit</text>

      <text x="260" y="306" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="13" fill="#8F3E2B" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">The Resistant</text>
      <text x="260" y="324" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="9" fill="#6B716C" text-anchor="middle">low capability &middot; low leverage</text>

      <text x="540" y="306" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="13" fill="#7A5F20" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">The Prompt Addict</text>
      <text x="540" y="324" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="9" fill="#6B716C" text-anchor="middle">high capability &middot; low leverage</text>

      <!-- Y axis -->
      <line x1="120" y1="60" x2="120" y2="380" stroke="#171C1A" stroke-width="1.6"/>
      <polygon points="120,52 116,64 124,64" fill="#171C1A"/>
      <text x="92" y="220" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#171C1A" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600" transform="rotate(-90 92 220)">Human Leverage &uarr;</text>
      <text x="112" y="76" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="8.5" fill="#9A9E95" text-anchor="end">Stewardship</text>
      <text x="112" y="376" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="8.5" fill="#9A9E95" text-anchor="end">Survival</text>

      <!-- X axis -->
      <line x1="120" y1="380" x2="680" y2="380" stroke="#171C1A" stroke-width="1.6"/>
      <polygon points="688,380 676,376 676,384" fill="#171C1A"/>
      <text x="400" y="406" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="11" fill="#171C1A" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">AI Capability &rarr;</text>
      <text x="120" y="396" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="8.5" fill="#9A9E95" text-anchor="start">Ignore</text>
      <text x="680" y="396" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="8.5" fill="#9A9E95" text-anchor="end">AI-Native</text>

      <!-- hidden reading -->
      <text x="400" y="438" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="9.5" fill="#0A5147" text-anchor="middle">&bull; hidden reading: Cognitive Sovereignty &mdash; what separates the upper half from the lower</text>
    </svg>
    <figcaption><span class="fn">The map.</span> Two axes, four positions. Reach runs left to right; leverage that survives AI runs bottom to top. The teal corner &mdash; high capability, high leverage &mdash; is the durable summit the book points toward.</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <p class="cover-note">Start with <strong>Locate Yourself</strong> to place your dot and your arrow. Then read the three parts: <strong>The Inversion</strong> (why value is migrating), <strong>The Map</strong> (where you stand in it), and <strong>The Defense</strong> (how to keep the faculty it all rests on).</p>

  <a class="cover-dl" href="https://ko-fi.com/s/2806feff25" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="ar">&nearr;</span>&nbsp; Get the full PDF on Ko-fi</a>

  <div class="cover-foot">By <b>Anuj Sadani</b> &middot; asadani.tech &middot; June 2026</div>
</header>

